-- Persistent Stalkers: the skin of the main menu and its profile panel
-- (AGENTS.md, "Skins").
--
-- This is the default skin of the main and pause menus: a profile box on
-- the left with the list and the inventory, and the game's options in the
-- right half with no frame of their own (ui_persistent_stalkers.xml). The
-- debug F8 window does not use get(): it keeps the full loadout. Another skin is a
-- small mod that replaces this one file (and brings its own layout), such as
-- romeo\gamedata in this repo, for the CLIKRAD ROMEO menu.
--
-- get() returns the fields to change, or nil for none; see DEFAULT_SKIN in
-- persistent_stalkers_menu.script for what each one does.

function get()
	return {
		layout = "ui_persistent_stalkers.xml",
		backpack = true,
		bag_stay = true, -- the backpack stays under the list, not beside the column
		details = false,
		note = false,
		what = false,
		compact = true, -- "New" / "Remove"
		rows = 8,
	}
end
